This directory vendors the ticket-creation kernel from
https://github.com/Topabaem05/Falsify (MIT, same copyright):

- packages/domain/src/errors.ts
- packages/domain/src/result.ts
- packages/domain/src/ranking.ts
- packages/domain/src/ticket-machine.ts

`create.ts` is the monitor's adapter. It follows the entry path in
Falsify `packages/application/src/commands/create-tickets.ts` (`buildTickets`):
schema-shaped validation, then DRAFT → QUEUED → ELIGIBLE, with the rank score
computed only by `ranking.ts`. It does not include Falsify's IndexedDB
workspace, WebMCP envelope, approval policy, or idempotency store. Those depend
on a research-contract project graph this monitor does not run.

`types.ts` is the slice of `packages/contracts/src/ticket.ts` the kernel reads.
The Zod schemas stayed in Falsify; this process checks the same bounds in
`create.ts`.
